# FIXED IN PART, DEFECT 2143, 2026-10-19, lane lane-witnessed-seed (panel
# 225's R1; the critic's `first`).
#
# What it guards: this module's unit is refused inside its own header, so
# its copy cannot compile either, and the probe of `fixedbugs2143/narrowing`,
# refused at `narrow`, is still asked: each refused unit's copy is asked on
# its own, and one that does not compile is silent alone. `narrow` itself,
# the second unit's own refusal, waits a build while defect 2143 is open.
use fixedbugs2143/narrowing

extern "fixedbugs-2143-open-attribute.h"  #~ ffi_header_refused
    constant K_ONE: i64

function main()
    print(K_ONE + narrowing.got())
